From 800026e17082f38078616a037db925669df3d645 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alaric McKenzie-Boone <alaric.mckenzie.boone@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 11:35:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] input: reusable scripted-pad override for menu/section
 fixtures (#397)

Add pc_port/pc_p2_input_script.{h,cpp}: a fixture sets a virtual pad per player
port and ControllerMgr::updateController() uses it instead of the physical pad
while active. Default-off and inert in production (returns false with no script
set). This lets a fixture drive ANY menu/section - results, map select, title -
without reaching into section internals, and enabled the lane-07 in-process
new-scene reload (MapSelect -> fresh gameplay area).
---
